{
  "description": "AuditMode Full (the default), Last(n) and Off change only what the audit trail keeps: the context, progress and error records are identical in every mode, Last(1) keeps the final entry, and Last(0) and Off keep none. A trace records its own changes in every mode (3.x's traced run had empty per-step changes under Off and Last(0)).",
